{"id":"vod_sn_35706","vodId":"35706","provider":"sn","providerName":"索尼资源","type":2,"name":"鬼灯的冷彻第一季","name_cn":"鬼灯的冷彻第一季","date":"2014-01-01","year":"2014","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"已完结","images":{"common":"https://snzypic.vip/upload/vod/20230911-1/662ee67998de0991cb871385b38947e8.jpg"},"summary":"令人忌惮而又好奇的黄泉幽冥界，轮回抵偿，善恶果报，一一得到判明。随着人口的大爆炸，前往阴曹地府的鬼魂也越来越多。冥司事务繁忙，坐镇中央的阎魔大王（长嶝高士 配音）自然不可小觑，而堪称左膀右臂的第一辅佐官鬼灯（安元洋贵 配音）更是令冥府上下都忌惮恐惧的超S级人物。他外表冷峻，不苟言笑，甚至对阎罗大王都敢出口不逊。恐怖森然的无间地狱，作恶之徒饱受罪业折磨。鬼灯大人虽然震慑感十足，却也和各种脱线的伙伴们无意中制造了不少的笑料和乐趣。上至天堂，下到龙宫，神道、鬼道、佛道、仙道、妖道、人道，圣者与众生的大聚会，欢乐层出不穷……　　本片根据江口夏实的原作漫画改编。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-09-11 15:37:00","playable":true,"episodeCount":13,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"snm3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/q8G54H7Rsp1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/mBZvrEJ6rx1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/10Vkiqh09c1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/2B8GiwAaSF1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/PKSxKLpWF51/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/Jq5EbN7trJ1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/8FweAtX2FL1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/9TSGsvPQba1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/ytvhcyQEns1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/sgxgBmD1pz1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/8qbzqnvuBg1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/V7VK1nbCrG1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第13集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/kBYYNUHvp01/video/index.m3u8"}]}],"snapshotAt":"2026-10-22T15:45:31.692Z"}